      272             VIEW-AS FILL-IN NATIVE
      273             SIZE 30 BY 1
      274        varfact-sum AT ROW 2.38 COL 38.63 COLON-ALIGNED
      275        ub.currency.curr-abbr AT ROW 2.42 COL 5.13 COLON-ALIGNED
      276             LABEL "Вал"
